  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tTime and Fees\n\t\tTime and Fees\n\n### Time and Fees: Accountant and Staff Access \n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 12 Mar, 2024 at  4:14 PM\n\n\t\tThis article will provide a step by step guide on how to give accountants and staff access to the Time and Fees Module\n\nPlease note that the main admin is able to do the following.\n\nLocation: Time and Fees > Manage > Permissions \n\nHere you can select access for:\n\nAdmin\n\nManager\n\nStaff\n\nWithin the categories you are able to set specific permissions for:\n\nTime\n\nJobs\n\nFees\n\nExpenses \n\nReports\n\nManage\n\nSetting\n\nActivity \n\nAnnouncement \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118370\">Time and Fees</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000199496\">Time and Fees</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Time and Fees: Accountant and Staff Access \n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 12 Mar, 2024 at  4:14 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.656; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">This article will provide a step by step guide on how to give accountants and staff access to the Time and Fees Module</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.656; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Please note that the main admin is able to do the following.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Location:</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;Time and Fees &gt; Manage &gt; Permissions&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Here you can select access for:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Admin</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Manager</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Staff</span></p></li></ul><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:602px;height:271px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9207451879/original/euspV2UHpDflo2Cya5oK3OQ2i_Ha8_oLFQ.png?1710259854\" width=\"602\" height=\"271\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9207451879\"></span></span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Within the categories you are able to set specific permissions for:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Time</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Jobs</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Fees</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Expenses&nbsp;</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Reports</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0p